+/// Partner-portal equivalent of Notification above - one row per
+/// (partner, message), independent isRead state per partner, same
+/// broadcast-fan-out shape as the user-facing system. No push: partners
+/// have no DeviceToken-equivalent (the portal is browser-only), so this is
